    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, so you're saying there isn't really a moral or practical justification for them then? like, if a country is literally committing genocide, isn't it kinda wrong to just stand by and do nothing because sanctions might \"backfire\"? it feels like you're saying we should just accept whatever bad stuff dictators do.",
